abstract: >-
  Boundary-aware adaptation of two frozen foundation models (SAM 2.1 Hiera-L
  and DINOv2 ViT-L/14) for four-class rooftop material segmentation at 0.14 m
  ground sampling distance, with 6.7 M trainable parameters.
